<title>USA: U.S. stockpile rejects vanadium pentoxide offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile rejects vanadium pentoxide offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center rejected the bids for vanadium pentoxide.</p>
<p>The next bids are due by 1000 EST, Jan 23 1997.</p>
<p>-- New Yrok Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
